menu "tiny Sticky"

config TINY_DASHBOARD_URL
    string "Dashboard base URL (settings QR target)"
    default "https://sticky.cagatay.my"
    help
        The settings page shows a QR code pointing at
        <this URL>/s/<device_id>, where a phone configures WiFi and toggles.
        It is the self-hosted dashboard under docs/dashboard; point this at
        your own deployment. The device sends no secret to it.

endmenu
